From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP cut ticket wall actually drops neighbor levels

Packed spawn relocated entities then aborted with corridor keys still
held: getTicketsAt empty, holder lvl=MAX, isSafeToUnload=ticket_level.
0045 skipPropagateTo left the pre-cut propagator cell in place, so
view-distance never let the Folia empty buffer unload. Zero that cell
and emit the holder update. Ticket clamp uses the bounded section AABB
(same box as merge BFS), not exact keys that left refill holes. Extra
cut-axis loads are absorbed into the hole and relocated — finishCarve
still aborts if anything remains. Not force-unload, not delete load.
Post-applyAllPatches.
---

--- a/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/scheduling/ThreadedTicketLevelPropagator.java
